    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live as a Frog who wants to eat everybody. Unfortunately, people are not so easily eaten. Solve mini-games and puzzles to beat them or find an alternative way to deal with them and skip those pesky puzzles. In the end, flies were not enough for this Frog.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through this top-down open world full of people enjoying their day.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden achievements and silly secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch or join a friendly soccer match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat everyone or simply dispatch them for your amusement.</p></li></ul>",
